#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md:1
msgid "Quantization families"
msgstr "量化类别"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor separates the quantization method, weight and "
"activation bit widths, strategy, and output ABI. Select these as one "
"policy and validate the resulting artifact in the target runtime."
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 将量化方法、权重和激活位宽、策略以及输出 ABI 分开。请将它们作为一个策略选择，并在目标运行时验证生成的构件。"

