msgid "`gptq`"
msgstr "`gptq`"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md
msgid "`awq`"
msgstr "`awq`"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md
msgid "`gptq` with AutoRound provenance"
msgstr "带有 AutoRound 来源信息的 `gptq`"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md:74
msgid ""
"The format is inferred from the method when omitted. An incompatible "
"explicit format is rejected."
msgstr "省略格式时会根据方法推断。不兼容的显式格式会被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md:76
msgid "Calibration and deployment boundary"
msgstr "校准与部署边界"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md:78
msgid ""
"GPTQ, AWQ, and AutoRound require representative calibration data and an "
"available execution backend. Calibration quality depends on sample "
"diversity and, for MoE models, whether selected experts receive "
"representative routed tokens."
msgstr "GPTQ、AWQ 和 AutoRound 需要代表性校准数据以及可用的执行后端。校准质量取决于样本多样性；对于 MoE 模型，还取决于所选专家是否接收到具有代表性的路由 token。"

#: ../../source/explanation/quantization-families.md:80
msgid ""
"A structurally valid artifact may still be unusable when the runtime "
"lacks the declared ABI, architecture mapping, or hardware kernel. Run "
"structural validation first, then runtime loading, accuracy, memory, and "
"throughput tests."
msgstr "结构有效的构件在运行时缺少声明的 ABI、架构映射或硬件内核时仍可能不可用。请先进行结构验证，再进行运行时加载、精度、内存和吞吐量测试。"
